ne-Wallet-SDK-for-iOS-with-your-app","text":"Integrating PingOne Wallet SDK for iOS with your app"},{"text":"Getting started: Add the dependencies needed for your application","anchor":"Getting-started-Add-the-dependencies-needed-for-your-application","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PingOne Wallet SDK for iOS relies on XCFramework components. You’ll need to add these to Xcode for use by your application."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you haven’t done so already, clone or download the PingOne Wallet SDK for iOS sample app. You will find the XCFramework dependencies required for the PingOne Wallet iOS SDK in the SDK directory."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the .xcframework dependencies:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a. Click on your target in the project navigator."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"b. Drag and drop all the xcframework dependencies to the section Frameworks, Libraries, and Embedded Content in Xcode."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add SVGKit via Swift Package Manager"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a. In Xcode go to File -> Add Packages…"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"b. Type https:\/\/github.com\/SVGKit\/SVGKit in the search bar."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"c. Choose Dependency Role and download the dependency.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Installation-and-configuration","type":"heading","text":"Installation and configuration","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set up iOS push messaging.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"App prerequisites","anchor":"App-prerequisites"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ensure you have the following information necessary to set up push notifications for your PingOne Wallet application:"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Key ID","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Team ID","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Token .p8 file"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Bundle ID"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"See the Apple guide Establishing a Token-Based Connection to APNs for more information."}]},{"text":"Configure push notifications","type":"heading","anchor":"Configure-push-notifications","level":2},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the PingOne documentation for Adding an application - Native to register your wallet app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"After adding your wallet application, go to Mobile -> Edit () -> Configure for iOS -> Add Push Notifications","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Upload your .p8 token and fill in the Key ID, Team ID, and Bundle ID values."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Save your changes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See the PingOne documentation Edit an application - Native for more information."}]},{"text":"Using universal links","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Using-universal-links"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Follow the iOS guide to set up universal links for your application.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Application developers are responsible for implementation of the Universal Links. You can follow the steps documented in Getting started with PingOne Credentials to configure the universal link in your PingOne environment for your mobile application."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Here’s a sample link generated for initiating wallet pairing and also for requesti